{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":1,"title":"앞에서 n개","desc":"<p>벡터 <code>x</code>의 <b>앞에서 n개</b>를 돌려주는 <code>first_n(x, n)</code>을 만드세요. <code>n</code>이 길이보다 크면 전체를 돌려줘요.</p>","solution":"first_n <- function(x, n) {\n  head(x, n)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>head(x, n)</code> 함수가 있어요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"first_n(c(1, 2, 3, 4), 2)","expected":[1,2],"visible":true},{"call":"first_n(c(1, 2), 5)","expected":[1,2],"visible":true},{"call":"first_n(c(\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"), 1)","expected":"a","visible":false},{"call":"first_n(1:5, 0)","expected":[],"visible":false}],"starter":"first_n <- function(x, n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-318"}